'''Firefly''' is a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]].
Can be found everywhere at Night. Fireflies can be equipped on a [[Fishing Pole]] to be used as [[Bait]].

==How to Acquire==

You can catch a firefly by right-clicking them while they are flying around, just like [[Ladybug]]s. They appear in [[Grassland]]s, [[Forest Terrain]]s, and most likely on [[Swamp]]s. Only at Night.

